---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Todo from '../components/Todo.astro';
import { site, pipecd, planetread } from '../data/site';
import { countByState, externalPrs, prsFor } from '../lib/github';

const pipe = countByState(prsFor('pipe-cd'));
const all = countByState(externalPrs());
---
<Page title="Resume" description="Resume of Rahul Shendre: LFX 2026 mentee on PipeCD (CNCF), PlanetRead, Go, TypeScript, Kubernetes.">
  <style>
    .cv { max-width: 46rem; }
    .cv h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.6rem; padding-bottom: 0.3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .cv .role { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .cv .role b { font-weight: 600; }
    .cv ul { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
    .cv li { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    @media print {
      :global(.site-header), :global(.site-footer), :global(.todo), .actions, .no-print { display: none !important; }
      :global(body) { background: #fff; color: #000; font-size: 10.5pt; }
      :global(main) { padding: 0 !important; }
      .cv h2 { margin-top: 1rem; break-after: avoid; }
      .cv ul, .cv .role { break-inside: avoid; }
      .cv a { text-decoration: none; }
      @page { margin: 14mm; }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="cv">
    <div class="actions"><a class="garage-link" href="/resume.pdf">DOWNLOAD PDF</a></div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.6rem;margin-bottom:.2rem">{site.name}</h1>
    <p class="mono" style="margin:0">{site.location} · <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> · <a href={site.links.github}>github.com/rahulshendre</a> · <a href={site.links.linkedin}>linkedin.com/in/rahul-shendre</a></p>

    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>Computer science student and open source contributor. LFX 2026 mentee on PipeCD (CNCF), focused on plugin development and developer experience. {all.merged} merged pull requests to open source projects, {pipe.merged} of them across PipeCD.</p>

    <h2>Open source</h2>
    <div class="role"><b>PipeCD (CNCF) · {pipecd.role}</b><span class="mono">2026</span></div>
    <ul>{pipecd.highlights.map((h) => <li>{h}</li>)}<li>Staffed the PipeCD booth at KubeCon India 2026</li></ul>
    <div class="role"><b>Other contributions</b><span class="mono">2025 to 2026</span></div>
    <ul><li>KubeStellar (core, UI, website), Sugarizer, Meshery, Gumroad, first-contributions</li></ul>

    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <div class="role"><b>{planetread.org} · {planetread.role}</b><span class="mono">{planetread.since} to present</span></div>
    <ul>
      <li>Built two Adobe Premiere Pro plugins that turn a text file into a caption track for Same Language Subtitling. Both are live on Adobe Exchange and support all 22 Indian languages (Click and Align, Slide and Align)</li>
      <li>Migrated the BookBox app completely to React Native with Expo, now on Google Play (10k+ downloads), the App Store and the Amazon Appstore</li>
      <li>Built an audio and subtitle mismatch checker (Whisper, Tesseract OCR, RapidFuzz) with an HTML review report, checked on Hindi, Marathi and Kannada, for C4GT DMP 2026</li>
      <li>Built the API layer and practice mode for Cricmaths, a maths-through-cricket site with 1,000+ daily users</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>cloudrun-mvp</b> (Go): PipeCD CLOUDRUN_SYNC flow against real Cloud Run, proof of work for a GSoC 2026 proposal</li>
      <li><b>saytask</b> (Python, macOS): voice and terminal capture into Google Tasks</li>
      <li><b>EduLite</b> (PWA, Supabase): offline-first learning app with regional language translation</li>
      <li><b>Suspicious activity detector</b> (Python, YOLO): real-time video analytics</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <p>{site.stack.join(' · ')}</p>

    <section class="no-print">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <Todo><p>Degree, college, expected graduation year.</p></Todo>
    </section>
  </div>
</Page>
